mediapool_tools_broken_media_title = Broken files
mediapool_tools_broken_media_scan_heading = Find broken and misnamed files
mediapool_tools_broken_media_description = Checks every file in the media pool: is it missing on the server, empty, does its content not match the extension (e.g. a PDF named .jpg), is an image damaged or truncated, or do size, type and dimensions in the media pool differ? Such files break output and make e.g. AI image descriptions fail. Files in the media folder without a media pool entry are listed as well.
